<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW JULY NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW JULY NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.07 vs   0.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.80 vs   1.31</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.99 vs   1.31</p>
<p> Sales		   28.59 vs  20.80</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.79 vs   4.97</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.01 vs   8.01</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.02 vs   7.43</p>
<p> Sales		  158.18 vs 127.29</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish meat-processing company is</p>
<p>Sokolowskie Zaklady Miesne SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
